<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
      a {
        color: #007bff;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
      a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }
      ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>Hello <%= userName %>,</p>
    <p>
      Your document titled <strong>"<%= documentName %>"</strong> has been
      reviewed by <%= approverName %> and was not approved.
    </p>

    <p><strong>Document Details:</strong></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Title:</strong> <%= documentName %></li>
      <li><strong>Submission Date:</strong> <%= submissionDate %></li>
      <li>
        <strong>Reason for Disapproval (if provided):</strong> <%=
        disapprovalReason %>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      You can address the feedback and make the necessary changes, or contact
      <%= approverName %> for further clarification.
    </p>

    <p>Click below to edit and resubmit the document:</p>
    <p><a href="<%= documentLink %>" target="_blank">Edit Document</a></p>

    <p>
      We appreciate your efforts and encourage you to review the feedback to
      improve the document.
    </p>

    <p>Best regards,</p>
    <p><%= companyName %> Team</p>
  </body>
</html>
